  {
    "id": "a307610df8b9357d93c5",
    "source": "Act in secret as a member of a pact your character is in (odm_get_pact). The table does not see it; the server rolls it where only you and whoever runs the story see, and it comes out when the pact moves or someone catches it. kind: steal (targetId and item; the item leaves its owner's pack now), scheme (something harmless, in text), harm (needs a table set to Turn) or attack (another player's character, when the pact moves in a fight; needs Turn). Refused during a fight, except attack.",
    "sourceHash": "a307610df8b9357d93c5c886dfc45ab5ebd8faaf20775f9ca491e6523672873e",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
